# Testing

- Framework: Vitest. Files: `tests/**/*.test.ts`. Alias: `@tests/*`.
- Unit tests mock ports/repositories; do not hit real DB unless writing repository/integration DB tests.
- HTTP integration tests use Supertest against the app factory with mocked infrastructure when appropriate.
- Mirror module structure under `tests/unit/modules/<feature>/...`.
- Cover use cases, validators, and mappers for new vertical slices.
- Prefer clear arrange/act/assert; name tests by behavior, not implementation.
